  "summary": "I wrote src/main.ts. It builds an orrery with a glowing orange emissive star at the centre, lit by a point light, and bloom. Five planets of different sizes and colours orbit at radii from 3 to 11 and speeds from 0.26 to 1.2 rad/s. The outermost planet, a larger sandy one, has a tilted flat ring made from a squashed torus that follows it each frame. Faint torus guides mark each orbit. The background is near-black, the camera is a fixed perspective at [0, 15, 19] looking at the origin, and `__EVAL_READY__` is set after `app.ready()`. `typecheck` passes, but I couldn't run the build or a browser here. The ring size, point-light intensity and bloom settings are untested guesses and may need tuning.",
